Z||000009||Spyder||10-30-2000||12:16 AM||||I’m the person who did the photochop.<BR>The pic was originally from old lars photo album.<BR>I did it to see what the Fiero would look like with an after market 300ZX fascia, especially since the 300ZX has the same lines as the Fiero fastback. I took measurements of the front ends and the Z front is just a little wider than the Fiero but everything else looks like it would line up with a little modification.  I was going to make a mold of my after market GRacer 300ZX fascia and then I was going to modify the fascia to fit the Fiero.  But I sold the fascia to add to the funds of my current project.  Here is a pic of the fascia that I was going to make fit the Fiero.  When I get done with my current project I want to try the modification. We’ll see.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.markalexandermiller.com/znewfront.JPG"> <BR>||||reg||12
